 about="From 1 August 2025 the Bihar Government announced up to 125 units a month of free electricity for all household consumers in the state. There is also a plan to set up solar plants on rooftops or nearby government land over the next three years, and the government will bear the full cost of solar for the poorest Kutir Jyoti families.",
 benefits=["Up to 125 units of electricity free every month","Target of reaching about 1.67 crore families","Help for solar plants (government to bear the full cost for the poorest Kutir Jyoti families)"],
